# Python test environment (agno-cursor-agent)

- **Never** run `pytest` or `python -m pytest` with bare Conda base, system Python, or only `PYTHONPATH=src`.
- **Always** use one of:
  - `./scripts/run-unit-tests.sh` (preferred; creates `.venv` if needed)
  - `source .venv/bin/activate` then `pytest …`
  - `uv sync --extra dev && uv run pytest …`
- Before reporting unit tests as passing after code changes, follow `.cursor/skills/agno-cursor-unit-tests/SKILL.md` (verifier subagent, then test-runner subagent).
